STUDENT PHOTO DATA

The sample student photos (`ai-service/student_photos/`) included in this
repository are used solely for demonstration purposes. If you fork or deploy
this project, replace all sample photos with properly consented images.
Ensure your deployment complies with applicable privacy laws (e.g., GDPR,
FERPA, PDPB) regarding the collection and storage of biometric data.
